<view class="page"><view class="content bind"><view class="title">把新伙伴带回家</view><view class="subtitle intro">扫描包装内的本体领养卡。衣装码请到衣橱绑定。</view><view wx:if="{{target}}" class="surface identity-card"><view class="title">{{target.number}}</view><text>正在为这只湾月核对领养卡</text></view><view class="scan-card surface"><text class="scan-mark">⌗</text><text class="scan-label">扫描卡片二维码</text></view><button class="primary-button" bindtap="scan">开始扫描</button><view class="code-label">或输入演示领养码（001／002）</view><view class="code-row"><input class="input-box code-input" placeholder="BUBU-DEMO-BODY-001" value="{{code}}" bindinput="input" /><button class="code-button" bindtap="submit">绑定</button></view><button class="help" bindtap="help">遇到问题？查看帮助</button></view></view>
